  "historyNote": "#5743, eff 11-24-93; ss by #7137, INTERIM, eff 11-24-99, EXPIRED: 3-23-00 New. #7244, eff 4-27-00, EXPIRED: 4-27-08 New. #9206, eff 7-19-08, EXPIRED: 7-19-16",
